min(input) -> Tensor

Returns the minimum value of all elements in the :attr:`input` tensor.

.. warning::
    This function produces deterministic (sub)gradients unlike ``min(dim=0)``

Args:
    input (Tensor): the input tensor.

Example::

    >>> a = torch.randn(1, 3)
